{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "dd55a8f0d10fdcaa64e530f84ca57617141e4599fa6ecf8a2bc75cc231e3e7d9", "ja": "逃げられない！", "zh": "逃不掉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "930ef6858d650f79f7ce7a5a32568b5da589e62101ad33926fe8c439bc6c3c76", "ja": "公演が終わり、やっと仕事が落ち着いてきた\nプロデューサー。ジュリアと恵美に打ち上げ\nの要望を聞くと、色々と面倒をかけさせられ\nたんだから、たっぷりお返ししてもらう！\nと、やる気満々なふたり。", "zh": "公演结束，工作终于渐渐告一段落的制作人。听到茱莉亚和惠美对庆功宴的要求后，两人干劲十足地说：  \n“既然让我们操了这么多心，就得好好补偿我们！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "151a86e8aa439243aaab82428c99512ebb0a1bc7cdd0ac286f7877bc8e0c61ab", "ja": "（ジュリアと恵美のデュオ公演が終わって、\nようやく忙しさも落ち着き始めた……）", "zh": "（茱莉亚和惠美的双人公演结束了，忙碌的工作也终于开始告一段落……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "b09c470c8ecfced8cefb8dd29ba1ee45073d01656d307b84b0757b71fb33fa31", "ja": "おっ、{$P$}、お疲れ。\nどこ行くんだ？　営業？", "zh": "哦，{$P$}，辛苦啦。要去哪儿？跑业务？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5e195b9199f88b820b9b37f586cc2193dd12192506cb0b596476e177f82d10b", "ja": "ん？　ああ、ふたりとも、お疲れさま。\n仕事が一段落したから、少し休憩しようと思って。", "zh": "嗯？啊，你们两个，辛苦了。\n工作告一段落了，我想稍微休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "34d9b135779b8067e9735ea77862b7c3d5cf8e728f0d28f215f6c2eabbd39118", "ja": "おっ、感心感心♪\nちゃんとサボれて、えらいぞ～？", "zh": "哦，不错不错♪\n能好好偷个懒，真能干呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fca46866bf63b9d5bb87ee242533c8d41338f1602a8ed3ac1b26ed0397e62f90", "ja": "仕事しないで褒められるとは……。\nまあ、それだけ心配かけてたって事かな。", "zh": "居然因为不工作而被夸奖……  \n嗯，也就是说，我让你担心了那么多吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "6d13a551f2fbbfbeb80ebee271501f2ec3bd04ac751cc7fc907712fd159b56b7", "ja": "そうそう。あんたって、ええと……\n仕事中毒って言うんだっけ？　そういうとこあるしな。", "zh": "对对。你啊，那个……该怎么说来着？好像有点工作狂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "2e7b85505e44e8f8102158140014c91f11759fa70f1b9ab4bdf075befb4cad9a", "ja": "だよね～。そういう人って、意識して休まないと\nダメらしいよ？　テレビかどっかで言ってた。", "zh": "对吧～。听说像你这样的人，不有意识地休息一下可不行哦？电视上还是哪儿说过来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "503e80dff952b1688e9514ea3ac0109c06ef83a8a2abbf8f5541cffb3ca98410", "ja": "はは、そうだよな……。\nあ、そうそう！　ふたりとも、今ちょっといいか？", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是……啊，对了！你们两个，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "799667e66dae2dd798b169e81e64c7579e77c72b434d8999a85017dd16638e03", "ja": "ん？　なんだよ……ってか、ストップ！\n仕事の話なら、休憩終わってから聞くから。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了……话说，暂停！\n要是工作上的事，等休息结束了我再听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "131edbd48703cc57c69415d05b62eebd4dd4dd68bb6fe3fb4dcb93e479ddd6cc", "ja": "休む時はしっかり休めよな！　そういうとこだぞ。", "zh": "该休息的时候就好好休息！就是因为你总是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "86fafdf466fc458598bb82895e3356ca44b4d5e6595d9c0bdeab47dbd416abb4", "ja": "い、いや、仕事の話じゃないよ。公演の打ち上げの話。\nどこか希望とかあるなら言っておいてくれ。", "zh": "不、不是在说工作的事。是说公演庆功宴的事。\n要是有什么想去的地方之类的，就提前说一声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "0ae8f0231c60d2e85fd98162045442ae34795c8442f22e1b98cb0339f890c779", "ja": "おーっ、打ち上げ！\nそう言えば、全然考えてなかったね。", "zh": "哦——庆功宴！\n这么一说，我们完全没考虑过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "0df91676ab6194fdcca4a4c82b4ef1a376d5f51cc4a2c35ddef628fbfb8fde40", "ja": "ウチら、本番で手いっぱいだったからな。\nん～……すぐには思いつかないな。", "zh": "我们俩在正式演出时已经忙得不可开交了。\n嗯……一时半会儿也想不出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1f476fbb8de92bc6043b4f35e286e5f926cf830113b65148c0d288628e0ac52a", "ja": "まあ急がないから。ふたりで考えておいてくれ。", "zh": "反正也不急。你们两个人先想想看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "bfcdf5eeec04270e98c51b666736b17c02f539edd46274904ae4ee200cdf2096", "ja": "あんまり遅くなると、打ち上げっぽくないし……\nファミレスとかでいいんじゃない？", "zh": "要是拖得太晚了，就不太像庆功会了……\n去家庭餐厅之类的地方不就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd7879afa1967be5ad0cc1c17a5403b9d4e1a5c696e52c6aee630ec578f86cde", "ja": "いや、ダメだ！　そんな適当じゃ。\n今回ウチら、かなり頑張ったんだからな。", "zh": "不行，不能这么随便！\n毕竟这次我们可是相当努力了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "3b77ee2886fa26cd43bc6b2092b01e46d36f7c01c37b2def85a5afc244f0c078", "ja": "お返しに、{$P$}には\n思いっきり面倒かけてやらないとな！", "zh": "作为回礼，可得让{$P$}好好忙活一番才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "4bda1f208c0a2a349048ffe92f960f60998558ff0f4e84303e0a4e832dc93e65", "ja": "そだね！　時間もたっぷり空けて\nもらって……ライブの感想とか、聞かないとね！", "zh": "对吧！得让你空出充足的时间……好好听听你对演唱会的感想才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6de3ba9a0512a3b133f235e499ff8ac14049e4d4f951ebd39cf1b59a68479bba", "ja": "ま、まあ、なるべく頑張るけど……。\nお手柔らかに頼むよ。", "zh": "呃、嗯，我会尽量努力的……还请手下留情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "a8571f287512a451eef06014649a95c8b3795b35f00f512215a8d449c2c215bd", "ja": "いいや！　手加減はしないぜ。\n絶対、逃がさないからな。", "zh": "不！我可不会手下留情。\n绝对不会让你逃掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "c159996659ca6c4f6148233cb82520d1fb748858a4556478d8b2435b24de898f", "ja": "覚悟しとけよ、バカPっ♪\n……なんてね～、にゃはは！", "zh": "给我做好心理准备，笨蛋制作人♪\n……开玩笑啦～，哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "70eb71f2aa672101849bd244c9e10f37f01570b5aa70a1f9b55405dc2cc5fa6f", "ja": "（やれやれ、これは逃げるわけにはいかないな。\n打ち上げ、全力で楽しませてもらおう！）", "zh": "（真是的，这下可不能逃了。庆功宴就让我尽情享受吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
